# aNotepad

> aNotepad.com is a free online notepad. Write, autosave, and share notes right in the browser - no download, no sign-up required to start. Supports plain text, rich text, markdown, to-do lists, whiteboards, and spreadsheets. Free accounts add cloud sync across devices; premium plans (from $1.99/month billed annually) remove ads and add AI writing, file attachments, audio notes, and API/MCP access. Available in 28 languages via language subdomains (es.anotepad.com, pt.anotepad.com, etc.).

Key facts:
- No sign-up needed: start typing at anotepad.com and the note autosaves as you type; create a free account to keep notes synced across devices.
- Note types: plain text, rich text (WYSIWYG), markdown, to-do/task list, whiteboard (drawing), and spreadsheet.
- Sharing: every note can be private, public (shareable read-only link), or password-protected.
- Notes can be downloaded as PDF or Word, printed, or sent by email; text files can be imported.
- Organize notes into collections; full-text search across your notes; version history for edited notes.
- Free tier is ad-supported. Premium removes all ads.
- Premium plans (billed annually): Plus $1.99/month - ad-free, AI Writing & AI Chat, file & image attachments, audio notes, 10MB notes, 50-version history; Pro $5.99/month - advanced AI models, 5x AI usage, REST API access, MCP integration; Max $17.99/month - priority AI processing, faster API/MCP, dedicated support. Monthly billing: $2.99 / $8.99 / $26.99.

## Core pages

- [Online notepad (start writing)](https://anotepad.com/): The main editor - plain text, autosaves as you type.
