## Developers & AI agents

- [REST API](https://anotepad.com/api-access): JSON HTTP API to create, read, and manage notes with a Personal Access Token (Pro and Max plans).
- [MCP server](https://anotepad.com/mcp-access): Connect Claude, ChatGPT, and other AI agents to your notes via the Model Context Protocol (endpoint: https://api.anotepad.com/mcp, OAuth-protected).

